  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201C;Combating hate speech for the sake of pluralism and tolerant democratic society&#x201D;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to reduce the level of hate speech in Armenia through non-formal education, awareness raising campaigns and national legislation amendment that will lead towards promotion of freedom of speech and protection against discrimination on political, economic, religious or other believes as well as educating new generation tolerant and open-minded.</narrative>
  </description>
